| productSpecChangelog | `需求变更.md` | product-spec-builder | log | onDemand |
| designBrief | `docs/设计简报.md` | design-brief-builder | source | onDemand |
| devPlan | `开发计划.md` | dev-planner | source | onDemand |
| currentExecution | `docs/plans/执行光标.md` | dev-builder | projection | onDemand |
| manualAcceptance | `验收记录.md` | dev-builder | log | onDemand |
| interfaceContracts | `接口契约.md` | product-spec-builder | source | onDemand |
| projectProfile | `项目画像.md` | sliver-vibe-coding | source | onDemand |
| constitutionDesign | `宪法设计.md` | sliver-vibe-coding | source | onDemand |
